  <!-- EN: Replace a lesser mechlink with a fully functional mechlink\n\nRemoves all the penalties of the lesser mechlink.\n\nNote: &lt;color=#f1ce02&gt;Like all other persona mechanoid operations, a mechanitor is required either directly or indirectly. If the only mechanitor you posses is the one you want to upgrade the mechlink of, utilize a Fabricor mechanoid to perform the operation by proxy as they are also capable of servicing persona mechanoids.&lt;/color&gt; -->
